WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.580
Marta phones Igor before leaving home. He is already outside.

2
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:09.390
Jaka jest dzisiaj pogoda?

3
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.080
Jest zimno i pada deszcz.

4
00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.830
Cold, and raining.

5
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:18.480
Znowu? Wczoraj też padało.

6
00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.330
Tak, ale jutro będzie ciepło.

7
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.700
To dobrze. Jutro idziemy do parku!

8
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:27.930
Pada deszcz.

9
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:34.210
Rain and snow both use the same verb, the verb to fall.

10
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.400
For cold, warm and hot, start with the word for is.

11
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:44.270
The name of a season changes its ending to say when.

12
00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.870
Ask what the weather is like today.

13
00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.830
Jaka jest dzisiaj pogoda?

14
00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:58.190
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

15
00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:01.950
Jaka jest dzisiaj pogoda?

16
00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.630
It is raining. Say it.

17
00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.190
Pada deszcz.

18
00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:15.550
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

19
00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:18.910
Pada deszcz.

20
00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:23.870
It is cold. Say it.

21
00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:28.430
Jest zimno.

22
00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:32.790
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

23
00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:36.150
Jest zimno.

24
00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:41.710
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
